+
+  - Add wrapper Actions to SCons.Defaults for $ASCOM, $ASPPCOM, $LINKCOM,
+    $SHLINKCOM, $ARCOM, $LEXCOM and $YACCCOM.  This makes it possible
+    to replace the default print behavior with a custom strfunction()
+    for each of these.
+
